# Known DIFF cases of `cargo xtask abi-diff` that come from the host, not from V2: CachyOS moved from
# linux-cachyos 7.2.11 to 7.3.0 on 22.10.2026 18:07 (INT-W12). V2 follows Linux 6.6 (the reference); 7.2 gave
# the same answer as V2. Remove a line when the reference moves past 6.6 and V2 follows.
abi-epoll nested: desk: a second pipe write wakes a polled pipe again in 6.6 (linux-6.6/fs/pipe.c:594 `was_empty || pipe->poll_usage`), so the outer ET epoll reports the inner one again (=1, as V2 and 7.2); 7.3 answers 0
